{"id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model.md","title":"Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL","display":"df-finite-gl-canonical-model — Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model","aliases":["72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model"],"display":"df-finite-gl-canonical-model — Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]","[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, proof of Theorem 2.4, L case, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"finite canonical world and relation definitions visually checked against source","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-gl-canonical-model — Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, proof of Theorem 2.4, L case, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"finite canonical world and relation definitions visually checked against source"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Adeq}_m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Phi\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,v,u\">\\(w,v,u\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi\">\\(W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi\\)</span> 是下式引入的集合、二元关系、赋值函数和三元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi(w,v)\">\\(R_\\Phi(w,v)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R_\\Phi\">\\(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R_\\Phi\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\">\\(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\subseteq\\Phi\">\\(w\\subseteq\\Phi\\)</span> 时所引入的有限公式集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_\\Phi\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\subseteq\\Phi:\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(w)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(w\\subsetneq u\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(u))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_\\Phi\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\subseteq\\Phi:\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(w)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(w\\subsetneq u\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(u))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in W_\\Phi\\times W_\\Phi:\\ &amp;\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m B\\in w\\Rightarrow\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}\\subseteq v)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m C\\in v\\setminus w)\\},\\\\\nV_\\Phi(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{w\\in W_\\Phi:p_i\\in w\\}\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Delta_\\Phi(w)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}:B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\Box_m B\\in w\\}\\quad(w\\subseteq\\Phi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in W_\\Phi\\times W_\\Phi:\\ &amp;\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m B\\in w\\Rightarrow\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}\\subseteq v)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m C\\in v\\setminus w)\\},\\\\\nV_\\Phi(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{w\\in W_\\Phi:p_i\\in w\\}\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Delta_\\Phi(w)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}:B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\Box_m B\\in w\\}\\quad(w\\subseteq\\Phi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书有限 adequate set 上的 L 典范构造，不能用全部极大一致集的通常无限典范模型代替。关系除了传递方框及其内容，还要求严格增加至少一个方框公式；这一额外条件给有限框架的非自反性。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 对子公式封闭，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi\">\\(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi\\)</span>。所有构造都由分离、幂集和有限集操作给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)\">\\(V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)\\)</span> 唯一确定。这里先定义三元组，不预先假定其非空性或真值引理；这些证明在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f13b228413db1156\" href=\"?note=f13b228413db1156\" title=\"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor\">72-lem-gl-canonical-successor</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a> 中给出。Remark 中这两条链接是后续导航，不是定义依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]] 的 $\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 和 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]] 的 $\\operatorname{Adeq}_m$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]] 的 $\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 和 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]] 的 $\\operatorname{Adeq}_m$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor","status":"resolved","id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书有限 adequate set 上的 L 典范构造，不能用全部极大一致集的通常无限典范模型代替。关系除了传递方框及其内容，还要求严格增加至少一个方框公式；这一额外条件给有限框架的非自反性。由于 $\\Phi$ 对子公式封闭，$\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi$。所有构造都由分离、幂集和有限集操作给出；$V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)$ 唯一确定。这里先定义三元组，不预先假定其非空性或真值引理；这些证明在 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 与 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 中给出。Remark 中这两条链接是后续导航，不是定义依赖。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书有限 adequate set 上的 L 典范构造，不能用全部极大一致集的通常无限典范模型代替。关系除了传递方框及其内容，还要求严格增加至少一个方框公式；这一额外条件给有限框架的非自反性。由于 $\\Phi$ 对子公式封闭，$\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi$。所有构造都由分离、幂集和有限集操作给出；$V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)$ 唯一确定。这里先定义三元组，不预先假定其非空性或真值引理；这些证明在 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 与 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 中给出。Remark 中这两条链接是后续导航，不是定义依赖。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"w,v,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi(w,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\subseteq\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W_\\Phi\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\subseteq\\Phi:\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(w)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(w\\subsetneq u\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}(u))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in W_\\Phi\\times W_\\Phi:\\ &\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m B\\in w\\Rightarrow\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}\\subseteq v)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(\\Box_m C\\in v\\setminus w)\\},\\\\\nV_\\Phi(i)&\\coloneqq\\{w\\in W_\\Phi:p_i\\in w\\}\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_\\Phi&\\coloneqq\\langle W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Delta_\\Phi(w)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\{\\Box_m B,B\\}:B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\land\\Box_m B\\in w\\}\\quad(w\\subseteq\\Phi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)","display":false}],"bytes":2722,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model|df-finite-gl-canonical-model — Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model|df-finite-gl-canonical-model — Finite adequate-set canonical model for GL]]"},{"id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]] 的有限 adequate set $\\Phi$、$W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi$，并使用 [[72-thm-gl-derivation-principles]] 的演绎、方框提升及方框假设规则。"},{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["2b98f8844a547104","67a60f891de62bc0","f13b228413db1156","d40b90e274cadbda"]}